  <result aggregation-status="1" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual Output Results</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.Number of automated weather stations (AWS) installed in Tavush, Gegharkunik and Syunik regions, and integrated with national system network.
2.Availability of modern software for hydrometeorological observation, forecast and scenario.
3.Number of introduced modelling tools and technologies for strategic climate vulnerability and hazard risk assessment and real-time monitoring.
4.Number of updated regional development plans in 3 target regions for incorporating climate change adaptation measures and risk reduction recommendations.
5.Availability of structural risk reduction measures designed and implemented in target regions using cost-benefit appraisal method.
6.Number of beneficiaries trained at capacity development workshops in support of local resilience building efforts, ensuring gender balance and inclusiveness.</narrative>
    </description>
